         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I recently added support to makefiels and regresison test script to run helgrind.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "80% of code passes fine, but a few places have some errors and the threading code has MANY (thousands of) errors.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Not sure how many are real. Probably many.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Debug, but not super high priority (since no otehrwise know bugs relating to this)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
